{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123959","id":4676970624,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFsTogA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123959","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123959.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123959.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123959","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123959/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123959/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123959/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/227b015974de7a09cf66d0848290ecbdba5aed45","number":123959,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Change default curve range for particle angles to [-1, 1]","user":{"login":"Megane-0","id":13514503,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTE0NTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13514503?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Megane-0","html_url":"https://github.com/Megane-0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Megane-0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Megane-0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Megane-0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Megane-0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Megane-0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Megane-0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Megane-0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Megane-0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Megane-0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #108934\r\n- Closes #91404\r\n\r\nWhen adding a curve to the Angle setting in a `ParticleProcessMaterial`, the default range was initialized to `-360` to `360`. Since the curve acts as a multiplier, this range caused particles to spin uncontrollably. This PR changes the default curve range for `PARAM_ANGLE` to `-1.0` to `1.0` so it functions correctly as a normalized multiplier.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis is a strictly scoped fix designed to resolve the reopened Angle curve issue without triggering previous regressions. \r\n\r\nA previous attempt to fix this (PR #91556) changed the default ranges for multiple particle multipliers at once, which inadvertently broke 3D directional velocity curves (Issue #115511) and had to be reverted (PR #116140). To prevent that from happening again, this PR *only* modifies the switch cases for `PARAM_ANGLE` in `cpu_particles_2d.cpp`, `cpu_particles_3d.cpp`, and `particle_process_material.cpp`. All other parameters remain untouched.\r\n\r\n*(AI Disclosure: I used an AI assistant as a learning tool to help navigate the Godot C++ codebase and research the Git history of the previously reverted PR. All code changes were manually applied, compiled, and tested.)*","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:partic